{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fed up with your dead-end dungeon job, you decide to quit. Only one problem; <i>the rest of the company stands in your way.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNDERLINGS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sow destruction as you battle your way through a corporate hell. Face hostile co-workers, feral creatures, corrupt managers, and everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/extras/4755254c7b8032bd8a812214357b2fb7.poster.avif?t=1767611362\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/extras/4755254c7b8032bd8a812214357b2fb7.webm?t=1767611362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/extras/4755254c7b8032bd8a812214357b2fb7.mp4?t=1767611362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GUBBINS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerup your underling with magical items called Gubbins, and discover powerful synergies. Sap health with the <strong>Leechsquito</strong>, spray and prey with the <strong>Killer Bees</strong>, blow everything up with the <strong>Kaboom-Shroom</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/extras/a91131c6aadd720938e851c799ca468d.poster.avif?t=1767611362\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/extras/a91131c6aadd720938e851c799ca468d.webm?t=1767611362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/extras/a91131c6aadd720938e851c799ca468d.mp4?t=1767611362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend through the floors of a randomly generated dungeon world, where every run is unique.\u00a0Collect bizarre powerups and endure unhinged trials, before facing the Underlord himself in your final exit interview. It's quittin' time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/extras/ab7d16733c4c2b0c8a1defe9527c57bf.poster.avif?t=1767611362\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/extras/ab7d16733c4c2b0c8a1defe9527c57bf.webm?t=1767611362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/extras/ab7d16733c4c2b0c8a1defe9527c57bf.mp4?t=1767611362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984600?t=1767611362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984600?t=1767611362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/fb4b93076d976d5fd377a0c1e68b18e38356a061/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767611362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/fb4b93076d976d5fd377a0c1e68b18e38356a061/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767611362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Vol